    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/94532d4751934bc0c17231c31e14ae23.poster.avif?t=1729516031\" width=660 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/94532d4751934bc0c17231c31e14ae23.webm?t=1729516031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart Dungeon is a 2.5D action Roguelite, with focus on dungeon exploration, item collection, skills and equipment, while the narrative is gradually presented through dialogues like a visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHAT DOES YOUR HEART LOOK LIKE?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/65d2a20ef4fe4cf2c6e0454f0ebc5dd4.poster.avif?t=1729516031\" width=660 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/65d2a20ef4fe4cf2c6e0454f0ebc5dd4.webm?t=1729516031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo is an imaginative boy who, after his daily activities like going to school and helping his mother with the housework, likes to play video games. One day, he gets a new game from his mother and finds himself immersed in it, transported inside his console.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he ventures into the game, he begins to realize how some things from reality begin to manifest themselves within this fantasy world. Soon, he comes across Enfermo, a cadaverous figure who controls the monsters in the dungeon, a manifestation of the disease his mother is fighting. Motivated to save his mother, our protagonist decides to face the monster, since he sees a connection between what happens inside the game and the outside world. However, things are not that simple\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOW IS YOUR HEART?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/dccc53a410b2a1017fc0f1355a9e463b.avif?t=1729516031\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new people and deepen your bonds to acquire new skills and weapons in the virtual world. The stronger your heart is, the stronger you are in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHAT IS YOUR HEART MADE OF?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/2dccc40c8014bdea54f240544dbfc7b8.avif?t=1729516031\" width=660 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striving for a great replay value, the player can express themselves with a diverse set of attacks, spells and items, combining them into it\u2019s own way of playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/94532d4751934bc0c17231c31e14ae23.poster.avif?t=1729516031\" width=660 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/94532d4751934bc0c17231c31e14ae23.webm?t=1729516031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart Dungeon is a 2.5D action Roguelite, with focus on dungeon exploration, item collection, skills and equipment, while the narrative is gradually presented through dialogues like a visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHAT DOES YOUR HEART LOOK LIKE?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/65d2a20ef4fe4cf2c6e0454f0ebc5dd4.poster.avif?t=1729516031\" width=660 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/65d2a20ef4fe4cf2c6e0454f0ebc5dd4.webm?t=1729516031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo is an imaginative boy who, after his daily activities like going to school and helping his mother with the housework, likes to play video games. One day, he gets a new game from his mother and finds himself immersed in it, transported inside his console.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he ventures into the game, he begins to realize how some things from reality begin to manifest themselves within this fantasy world. Soon, he comes across Enfermo, a cadaverous figure who controls the monsters in the dungeon, a manifestation of the disease his mother is fighting. Motivated to save his mother, our protagonist decides to face the monster, since he sees a connection between what happens inside the game and the outside world. However, things are not that simple\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOW IS YOUR HEART?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/dccc53a410b2a1017fc0f1355a9e463b.avif?t=1729516031\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new people and deepen your bonds to acquire new skills and weapons in the virtual world. The stronger your heart is, the stronger you are in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHAT IS YOUR HEART MADE OF?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220790/extras/2dccc40c8014bdea54f240544dbfc7b8.avif?t=1729516031\" width=660 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striving for a great replay value, the player can express themselves with a diverse set of attacks, spells and items, combining them into it\u2019s own way of playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Heart Dungeon is a 2.5D Roguelite about defeating monsters and strengthening your heart. Leo is a boy who receives a new game from his mother and finds himself immersed in it, transported to a virtual world that manifests things from his reality within this fantasy.",
